OL,3,AOpenAI and Anthropic bosses push UN for
OL,4,Aglobal terms on AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this month, Amodei wrote an
OL,7,Fessay welcomed by Altman and others
OL,8,Fcalling an AI development slowdown in
OL,9,Fresponse to fears about the
OL,10,Ftechnology's threat to humanity.
OL,12,FHowever, at the same UN conference, a
OL,13,Fkey technology advisor to US President
OL,14,FDonald Trump, rejected the idea any new
OL,15,Fform of AI regulation.
